note	Note	code=4 pre=1	Create a service instance	body	Run cf create-service cleardb spark mysql. This creates a service instance named mysql that uses the cleardb service and the spark plan, as the example below shows. $ cf create-service cleardb spark mysql Creating service mysql in org Cloud-Apps / space development as clouduser@example.com.... OK
